%N A397121 Number of rooted unlabeled cacti with blocks of sizes 5, 7 and 9, having n blocks.
%H A397121 Frédéric G. Speyser, <a href="/A397121/b397121.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..100</a>
%H A397121 Frédéric G. Speyser, <a href="https://github.com/frederic-speyser/cactus-mixed-cycle-lengths">mgonal_cactus_series_omega_blocks.py</a>
%H A397121 Frédéric G. Speyser, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22117807">Enumeration and Asymptotic Analysis of Strict Non-Plane Cactus Graphs over a Finite Set of Cycle Lengths</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
%F A397121 G.f.: s(x) satisfies s(x) = exp(Sum_{i>=1} K(x^i)/i), where K(x) = K_5(x) + K_7(x) + K_9(x), each K_m(x) = (x/2)*(s(x)^(m-1) + s(x^2)^((m-1)/2)) for m odd. The critical value has a closed algebraic form in the vertex-indexed variable (the unique positive root of 4*y^4 + 6*y^6 + 8*y^8 = 2 - see the paper).
